@startuml
[*] --> Registration : Registration Start
Registration --> SignedIn : Registration Complete
Registration --> RegistrationFailed : Registration Failed
RegistrationFailed --> [*] : End Access
SignedIn --> ViewingResults : View Result
SignedIn --> PaymentProcessing : Payment Method Selected
ViewingResults --> SignedIn : Continue Using System
ViewingResults --> Registration : Finish Session
PaymentProcessing --> SignedIn : Payment Processed
SignedIn --> Feedback : Service Completion
SignedIn --> [*] : Session End/Log Out
